{"completed": true, "response": "{\"valid\":true,\"why\":\"成立。H2 已明确建立了“真实享受亲近→亲近越显珍贵→越不忍它转瞬即逝”的因果关系，因此“先前的满足让他更珍惜这份亲近；越享受其中，他越舍不得它结束”不是新增前提。当前 S04-B1 的“比第一次更华丽、更迫切”、反复补说细节，S04-B3 的“不自觉握得更紧、想牢牢抓住当下”，以及 S04-B4 的“美好仍在发生却已经舍不得、歌声越美越想多留一刻”，都具体支持这种由欢喜与珍惜催生急切的机制。解释不仅宣布‘急切’，也给出了其原因：正因为已经体验到亲近的满足并愈发珍惜，才更抗拒这一刻结束。\",\"coverage_gaps\":[\"S04-B2：情绪冲到最炽热、仿佛完整打开，却又一边向上争取一边退弱、没有稳稳落下，以及第34小节随后安静下来的回荡感尚未解释。\",\"S04-B3：越用力抱紧、越使水面颠簸和平衡变脆弱这一层‘抓紧本身反而带来不稳’的矛盾感尚未解释。\"]}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6987c5e2-65ab-460e-ac23-6c7349ac4db6", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T045534827698Z", "elapsed_seconds": 11.438, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T04:55:46.258915+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "56ed80f1bdfa23f88d2184ba19c8aa2c83f05723c3b2da291c8243fb38ea79f9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedf